    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i know i should probably talk to someone but it feels pointless. like even if i talk about it, the grayness stays. it's just there. constant. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. i'm just so tired of existing in this vacuum. it's exhausting to pretend to be a person when you don't feel like one.",
